<p>Removes all detrimental effects but causes you to burn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 11%, 9%, 6%, 5%</acronym> of your max health per effect, over 7 turns.</p><p>This ignores all resists, defenses, and affinities.</p><p>This does not take a turn.</p>